[7m Manual page systemctl(1) line 364 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K [KESCESC[KOO[KBB[K         Bind-mounts a file or directory from the host into the specified unit's mount namespace. The first path argument is the source file or directory on  the  host,  the[m
[7m Manual page systemctl(1) line 365 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K [KESCESC[KOO[KBB[K         second  path argument is the destination file or directory in the unit's mount namespace. When the latter is omitted, the destination path in the unit's mount name‐[m
[7m Manual page systemctl(1) line 366 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K [KESCESC[KOO[KBB[K         space is the same as the source path on the host. When combined with the --read-only switch, a read-only bind mount is  created.  When  combined  with  the  --mkdir[m
[7m Manual page systemctl(1) line 367 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K [KESCESC[KOO[KBB[K         switch, the destination path is first created before the mount is applied.[m
[7m Manual page systemctl(1) line 368 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K [KESCESC[KOO[KBB[K[m
[7m Manual page systemctl(1) line 369 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K [KESCESC[KOO[KBB[K         Note  that  this option is currently only supported for units that run within a mount namespace (e.g.: with RootImage=, PrivateMounts=, etc.). This command supports[m
[7m Manual page systemctl(1) line 370 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K [KESCESC[KOO[KBB[K         bind-mounting directories, regular files, device nodes, AF_UNIX socket nodes, as well as FIFOs. The bind mount is ephemeral, and it is undone as soon as the current[m
[7m Manual page systemctl(1) line 371 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K [KESCESC[KOO[KBB[K         unit process exists. Note that the namespace mentioned here, where the bind mount will be added to, is the one where the main service process runs. Other  processes[m
[7m Manual page systemctl(1) line 372 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K [KESCESC[KOO[KBB[K         (those exececuted by ExecReload=, ExecStartPre=, etc.) run in distinct namespaces.[m
[7m Manual page systemctl(1) line 373 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K [KESCESC[KOO[KBB[K[m
