  38 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[38;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[K[H(B[m[38:2:84:92:126m<<<(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m5 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[1;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mstatement, and (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m import without (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoding(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m the path to (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.[3C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m itself was problematic. Firstly to import (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m without      [3C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoding(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m the path to it,  after the shebang statement, I placed the[6C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mfollowing:(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m-(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[58X[5;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m16 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[5;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[11X[6;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m8 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[6;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106mCURR_SCRIPT_DIR="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")" && pwd)"[7;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m9 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[7;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106msource "$CURR_SCRIPT_DIR/../etc/naledi.conf"(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[19X[8;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m21 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[8;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mInitially, I used the echo command and redirected the output using (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m>(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m to[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthe created shell script. However, the variable calls in those two lines[3C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mwould be written into that file after being expanded out, meaning the path[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mto (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m would be written as is in the new file, resulting in a     [C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoded(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m path, which is what we want to avoid.[22X[13;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m22 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[13;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[47X[14;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m3 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[14;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI tried escaping the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m$(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m for each variable with (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m\(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m,  it did not work, I in[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mfact got syntax error because of my bad placement of those but even when I[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mdid place them correctly, it did not work. I also tried placing the       [C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mvariable calls in single quotes, that did not help either.[9X[18;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m24 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[18;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[58X[19;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m5 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[19;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mWhat eventually did work was using (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mprintf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m with the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m%s(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m option,  and with[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthat I was able to preserve and write those two lines as is.[11X[21;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m26 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[21;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[60X[22;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m7 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[22;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:158:206:106m[48:2:39:45:45