nes as is.[21;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m6 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[21;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[23X[22;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m7 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[22;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:158:206:106m[48:2:39:45:45m### What I accomplished(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[47X[23;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m28 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[23;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI managed to successfully complete, test and use my automation shell      (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mscripts being my_run.sh and my_touch.sh as well use them for creating other (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mshell script files (module shell scripts so far and the seeding shell[6C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mscript)[27;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m29 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[27;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[74X[28;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m30 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[28;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mLastly, I achieved completing my shell script for seeding data. Although[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mit only seeds herd_registry.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m, districts.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m and quarantine_zones.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat[4C(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245monly so far.[31;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m1 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[31;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[15X
