     (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mfollowing:(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m-(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[58X[4;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m16 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[4;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[11X[5;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m8 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[5;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106mCURR_SCRIPT_DIR="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")" && pwd)"[6;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m9 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[6;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106msource "$CURR_SCRIPT_DIR/../etc/naledi.conf"(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[19X[7;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m21 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[7;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mInitially, I used the echo command and redirected the output using (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m>(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m to[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthe created shell script. However, the variable calls in those two lines[3C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mwould be written into that file after being expanded out, meaning the path[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mto (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m would be written as is in the new file, resulting in a     [C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoded(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m path, which is what we want to avoid.[22X[12;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m22 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[12;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[47X[13;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m3 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[13;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI tried escaping the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m$(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m for each variable with (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m\(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m,  it did not work, I in[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mfact got syntax error because of my bad placement of those but even when I[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mdid place them correctly, it did not work. I also tried placing the       [C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mvariable calls in single quotes, that did not help either.[9X[17;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m24 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[17;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[58X[18;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m5 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[18;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mWhat eventually did work was using (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mprintf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m with the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m%s(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m option,  and with[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthat I was able to preserve and write those two lines as is.[11X[20;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m26 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[20;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[60X[21;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m7 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[21;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:158:206:106m[48:2:39:45:45m### What I accomplished[22;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m8 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[22;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI managed to successfully complete, test and use my automation shell[5C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mscripts being my_run.sh and my_touch.sh as well use them for creating other (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mshell script files (module shell scripts so far and the seeding shell       (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mscript)[62X[26;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m29 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[26;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[7X[27;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m30 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[27;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mLastly, I achieved completing my shell script for seeding data. Although[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mit only seeds herd_registry.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m, districts.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m and quarantine_zones.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m   [C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245monly so far.[59X[30;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m31 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[30;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[12X[31;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m2 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[31;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:26:188:156m[48:2:26:43:50m#### Chain link[32;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m5 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[32;7H (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104mChain link                                                               [C[C(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m963e040199448fef378871c5a51926f0c3c7a5c046e589649c6d4483c9a4b5e9(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[K[34;3H(B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m36 (B[0;1m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[34;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106m[48:2:41:46:66m```(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[48:2:41:46:66m                                                                [66D[?2026l[?2026h[39;20H(B[m[38:2:42:195:222m[48:2:22:22:30m541322 (B[m[38:2:169:177:214m[48:2:22:22:30m[39;28H(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[48:2:22:22:30m 󰍔[39;30H (B[0;1m[38:2:192:202:245m[48:2:22:22:30m logbook.md(B[m[38:2:169:177:214m[48:2:22:22:30m (B[m[38:2:187:154:247m[48:2:22:22:30m gj (B[m[38:2:169:177:214m[48:2:22:22:30m[39;48H(B[m[38:2:42:195:222m[48:2:22:22:30m [39;50H 16 (B[m[38:2:169:177:214m[48:2:22:22:30m[39;55H(B[m[38:2:68:157:171m[48:2:22:22:30m [39;57H 41 (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m[48:2:22:22:30m[39;62H(B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:59:66:97m 87%  36:2 [34;9H[?2026l[?2026h[A(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m [34;9H[?2026l[?2026h[32A [81C(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m [5B [81C(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m [81C(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m [81C(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 


