 [35;9H[?2026l[?2026h[C[?2026l[?2026h[39;71H(B[m[38:2:158:206:106m[48:2:59:66:97m3[35;10H[?2026l[?2026h[1;8H(B[m[38:2:192:202:245mstatement, and (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m import without (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoding(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m the path to (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.   (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mc(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245monf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m itself was problematic. Firstly to import (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m without          (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mh(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mardcoding(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m the path to it,  after the shebang statement, I placed the       f(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mollowing:(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m-[5;4H6 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[5;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[63X[6;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m8 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[6;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106mCURR_SCRIPT_DIR="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")" && pwd)"[7;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m19 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[7;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106msource "$CURR_SCRIPT_DIR/../etc/naledi.conf"(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[27X[8;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m21 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[8;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mInitially, I used the echo command and redirected the output using (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m>(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m to [3C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthe created shell script. However, the variable calls in those two lines  [C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mwould be written into that file after being expanded out, meaning the path[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mto (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m would be written as is in the new file, resulting in a[6C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoded(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m path, which is what we want to avoid.[13;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m2 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[13;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[71X[14;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m23 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[14;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI tried escaping the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m$(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m for each variable with (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m\(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m,  it did not work, I in   [C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mfact got syntax error because of my bad placement of those but even when I[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mdid place them correctly, it did not work. I also tried placing the[8C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mvariable calls in single quotes, that did not help either.[18;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m4 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[18;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[71X[19;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m25 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[19;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mWhat eventually did work was using (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mprintf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m with the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m%s(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m option,  and with[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthat I was able to preserve and write those two lines as is.[21;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m6 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[21;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[23X[22;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m7 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[22;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:158:206:106m[48:2:39:45:45m### What I accomplished(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[47X[23;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m28 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[23;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI managed to successfully complete, test and use my automation shell      (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mscripts being my_run.sh and my_touch.sh as well use them for creating other (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mshell script files (module shell scripts so far and the seeding shell[6C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mscript)[27;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m29 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[27;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[74X[28;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m30 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[28;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mLastly, I achieved completing my shell script for seeding data. Although[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mit only seeds herd_registry.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m, districts.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m and quarantine_zones.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat[4C(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245monly so far.[31;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m1 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[31;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[15X[32;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m2 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[32;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:26:188:156m[48:2:26:43:50m#### Chain link(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[58X[33;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m35 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[33;7H (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104mChain link                                                               [C[C(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m963e040199448fef378871c5a51926f0c3c7a5c046e589649c6d4483c9a4b5e9
