(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m  21   (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mInitially, I used the echo command and redirected the output using (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m>(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m to[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthe created shell script. However, the variable calls in those two lines[3C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mwould be written into that file after being expanded out, meaning the path[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mto (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m would be written as is in the new file, resulting in a[6C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoded(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m path, which is what we want to avoid.
(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m  22   
  23   (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI tried escaping the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m$(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m for each variable with (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m\(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m,  it did not work, I in[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mfact got syntax error because of my bad placement of those but even when I[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mdid place them correctly, it did not work. I also tried placing the[8C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mvariable calls in single quotes, that did not help either.
(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m  24   
  25   (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mWhat eventually did work was using (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mprintf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m with the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m%s(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m option,  and with[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthat I was able to preserve and write those two lines as is.
(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m  26   
  27   (B[0;1m[38:2:158:206:106m[48:2:39:45:45m### What I accomplished
(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m  28   (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI managed to successfully complete, test and use my automation shell[5C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mscripts being my_run.sh and my_touch.sh as well use them for creating other (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mshell script files (module shell scripts so far and the seeding shell[6C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mscript)
(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m  29   
  30   (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mLastly, I achieved completing my shell script for seeding data. Although[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mit only seeds herd_registry.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m, districts.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m and quarantine_zones.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat[4C(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245monly so far.
